id: settings-typing
section: Keyboard and text
item: Type in about:settings' fields on the system keyboard (keys reach the XUL page): a character lands in a text field and Enter writes the pref
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-preferences-ui.md R6
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
tap 'sel:button.pane-tab[data-pane="content"]'
wait rect 'sel:button.pane-tab.on[data-pane="content"]' 5
tap 'sel:.row[data-pref="browser.display.background_color"] input'
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys x
chrome kb-enter
wait pref s browser.display.background_color x 6
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
